      "worked": "For $a,b>0$, $a\\ne1$ and $b\\ne1$, change to base $b$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_a(b)&=\\frac{\\log_b(b)}{\\log_b(a)}\\\\\\log_a(b)&=\\frac{1}{\\log_b(a)}.\\end{align*}$$",
